# ---- MATLAB ----
*.asv
*.mex*
slprj/

# ---- Captured runs ----
# Real telemetry and step-response captures are run-specific and can be
# large. Keep them out of the repo by default; commit a specific run
# deliberately with `git add -f data/run_good.csv` if it is one you want
# to keep as a reference or replay at a review.
data/step.csv
data/run_*.csv
data/*_raw.csv
data/plant_params.json
data/plant_params_matlab.json

# The synthetic example data, the fitted example params and the generated
# figures ARE tracked on purpose -- docs/ and data/README.md refer to them,
# and they let someone clone the repo and see real output without any
# hardware. See data/README.md.
